  "explanations": {
    "1": "小明星期天不上学，表示否定。",
    "2": "表示起床后做的第一件事。",
    "3": "连接小明和妈妈两个一起吃饭的人。",
    "4": "妈妈问小明想吃什么，疑问代词。",
    "5": "引出看电视的地点在家里。",
    "6": "表示看电视的动作已经完成。",
    "7": "去书店的目的是买书。",
    "8": "表示书店里存在很多书。",
    "9": "数量词，表示两本书。",
    "10": "表示小明和朋友一起，用跟代替和避免重复。",
    "11": "量词，用于修饰饭店。",
    "12": "程度副词，强调面条很好吃。",
    "13": "指示代词，指代之前提到的饭店。",
    "14": "去公园的目的是玩耍。",
    "15": "公园里有很多人。",
    "16": "程度副词，表示小明非常喜欢狗。",
    "17": "疑问代词，询问狗的主人。",
    "18": "表示玩耍持续到下午五点。",
    "19": "名量词，表示写汉字的计量单位。",
    "20": "程度副词，妈妈夸奖小明写得好。"
  },
  "translation": "Today is Sunday. Xiao Ming does not go to school. In the morning, he gets up at eight o'clock, and first washes his face. Then he and his mother eat breakfast together. Mother asks: \"What do you want to eat?\" Xiao Ming says: \"I want to eat steamed buns and milk.\" After breakfast, Xiao Ming watches TV at home. He watches for one hour. At ten o'clock in the morning, he goes to the bookstore to buy books. There are many books in the bookstore. He buys two Chinese books. At noon, he and his friend have lunch together. The friend says: \"That restaurant's noodles are very delicious!\" Xiao Ming says: \"OK, let's go eat there.\" In the afternoon, they go to the park to play together. There are many people in the park. They see a dog. Xiao Ming really likes dogs. He asks: \"Whose dog is this?\" A girl says: \"It's mine. Its name is 'Little White'.\" Xiao Ming and his friend play until five o'clock in the afternoon. Then they go home. In the evening, Xiao Ming writes one page of Chinese characters. Mother says: \"You write really well!\" Xiao Ming is very happy."
